pseudowire-class VPWS_CB_CW
 encapsulation mpls
 control-word
!
interface GigabitEthernet5
 description CustB multi-service UNI -- VLAN11 VPWS VC2011 | VLAN12 EVPN(S3B,reserved)
 no ip address
 no ipv6 address 2001:DB8:1:23::1/64
 no keepalive
 service instance 11 ethernet
  description VPWS E-Line VC 2011 -> CustB-Spk1<->Hub
  encapsulation dot1q 11
  rewrite ingress tag pop 1 symmetric
  xconnect 10.1.0.5 2011 encapsulation mpls pw-class VPWS_CB_CW
